@startuml Seat Analyzer - User Flow & Data Flow
!theme aws-orange

title Seat Vacancy Analyzer - User Flow & Data Flow Diagram

skinparam backgroundColor #f8f9fa
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

actor "Bus Passenger" as User
actor "Bus Driver" as Driver
actor "System Admin" as Admin

participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "3D Seat Visualization" as SeatViz
participant "Backend API" as API
participant "Real-time Engine" as RealTime
participant "Database" as DB
participant "IoT Sensors" as IoT
participant "Payment Gateway" as Payment

== User Journey: Checking Seat Availability ==

User -> App : Open app, select route
App -> API : GET /api/routes/{routeId}/buses
API -> DB : Query available buses
DB --> API : Return bus list with crowd levels
API --> App : Bus list with seat availability
App -> SeatViz : Display 3D bus with seat map
SeatViz --> User : Interactive seat visualization

note right of User
  **User sees:**
  • Available seats (green)
  • Occupied seats (red)
  • Reserved seats (yellow)
  • Premium seats (blue)
  • Predicted availability
end note

== Real-time Seat Updates ==

IoT -> RealTime : Sensor data (seat occupied/vacant)
RealTime -> API : Process sensor readings
API -> DB : UPDATE real_time_seat_status
DB --> API : Confirm update
API -> App : WebSocket broadcast
App -> SeatViz : Update seat status
SeatViz --> User : Live seat map update

note right of IoT
  **Sensor Data:**
  • Pressure readings
  • Weight detection
  • Occupancy changes
  • Confidence scores
  • Timestamp
end note

== Seat Reservation Flow ==

User -> SeatViz : Select preferred seat
SeatViz -> App : Seat selection
App -> API : POST /api/reservations/create
API -> DB : Check seat availability
DB --> API : Seat available confirmation
API -> Payment : Initiate payment
Payment --> API : Payment confirmation
API -> DB : CREATE seat reservation
DB --> API : Reservation created
API --> App : Reservation success + QR code
App --> User : Digital boarding pass

note left of Payment
  **Payment Options:**
  • UPI/Digital wallets
  • Credit/Debit cards
  • BMTC pass balance
  • Cash on board
end note

== Boarding Process ==

User -> Driver : Show QR code
Driver -> App : Scan QR code
App -> API : POST /api/reservations/checkin
API -> DB : UPDATE reservation status
DB --> API : Check-in confirmed
API -> RealTime : Broadcast seat occupied
RealTime -> SeatViz : Update seat status
SeatViz --> "Other Users" : Real-time seat update

== Predictive Analytics Flow ==

loop Every 15 minutes
  API -> DB : Collect historical data
  API -> "ML Engine" : Run prediction model
  "ML Engine" --> API : Seat availability predictions
  API -> DB : UPSERT seat_availability_predictions
  DB --> API : Predictions stored
  API -> App : Push predictions to users
  App --> User : "Seat available in 10 mins"
end

== Admin Monitoring ==

Admin -> "Admin Dashboard" : Monitor system
"Admin Dashboard" -> API : GET /api/admin/analytics
API -> DB : Query seat analytics
DB --> API : Analytics data
API --> "Admin Dashboard" : System health & metrics

note right of "Admin Dashboard"
  **Admin Views:**
  • Real-time occupancy
  • Revenue analytics
  • IoT device status
  • User satisfaction
  • Prediction accuracy
end note

== Error Handling & Maintenance ==

IoT -> RealTime : Sensor malfunction
RealTime -> API : Log sensor error
API -> DB : UPDATE iot_device_status
API -> Admin : Alert notification
Admin -> "Maintenance Team" : Schedule maintenance
"Maintenance Team" -> IoT : Fix/replace sensor
IoT -> RealTime : Resume normal operation

== Data Analytics Loop ==

loop Daily
  DB -> "Analytics Engine" : Extract journey data
  "Analytics Engine" -> DB : Generate seat_analytics
  "Analytics Engine" -> "ML Engine" : Train prediction models
  "ML Engine" -> DB : Update model accuracy
  DB -> API : Serve improved predictions
end

note bottom of DB
  **Data Flow:**
  1. IoT sensors provide real-time data
  2. User interactions create reservations
  3. Analytics improve predictions
  4. ML models optimize recommendations
  5. Feedback loop enhances accuracy
end note

@enduml
